# Layout 4 — CRM split (record left, workstream right)

Left = compact metadata stack (Details/Labels/Connected/Versions). Right = Notes/Tasks/Activity always on screen, side by side with the record. Annotations promoted to co-equal.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Tools / Hammer drill  [v3 Draft]                             [Publish] [⋮]       │
├───────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Details                       │  Notes │ Tasks │ Activity                        │
│  Name     Hammer drill        │ ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  Power    1100 W              │ │ [＋ Add note…]                               │ │
│  Weight   2.9 kg              │ │                                              │ │
│ ───────────────────────────── │ │ ▸ "Check chuck wear"                         │ │
│ Labels                        │ │    Kalle · 2d ago                            │ │
│  ◉ heavy ◉ rental [+]         │ │                                              │ │
│ ───────────────────────────── │ │ ▸ "Manual PDF linked in description"         │ │
│ Connected          [+ add]    │ │    Anna · 5d ago                             │ │
│  → Site kit A                 │ │                                              │ │
│  ← Depot 7 [v2]               │ │                                              │ │
│  ← Crew North                 │ │                                              │ │
│ ───────────────────────────── │ │                                              │ │
│ Versions                      │ │                                              │ │
│  ● v3 Draft  ○ v2  ○ v1       │ │                                              │ │
│  [Publish] [New version]      │ └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
└───────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Pros:** write a note while reading the record — no scroll/tab dance; clear "facts vs work" split.
**Cons:** metadata column gets long w/ many fields (scrolls independently); annotations get prime real estate even when empty.
**Best when:** notes/tasks/activity are used daily, i.e. instances are living work objects, not reference data.
